List of changes made
1. The interfaces for setting algorithm parameters / writing them into the compressed data stream / reading them back
   have been replaced with simple parameter-setting functions in the compressor and decompressor: "SetupProperties()"
2. Memory is released when compression/decompression finishes
3. FindMatchFinder reworked to use char instead of wchar_t
4. Range coder buffer reduced from 1 mb to 64 kb: _range??coder.Create(BUFFER_SIZE)
5. restore: During decompression, writing is performed every 256 kb (LZ_CHUNKS) - see _flushPos
6. BinTreeMain.h: hash size and memory allocation (CalcHashSize)
7. kDicLogSizeMaxCompress = 31;  HASH_TABLE;  hashSize
8. compress_all_at_once
9. maxDist[] = {0, 0, 128, 2048, 64<<10, 2<<20, 12<<20}
10. len + 1 >= lenMain ...